description.narrative:
- Supporting the development and implementation of technical cooperation projects and programs aimed at strengthening education sector planning capacities, particularly in the areas of education sector analyses and the preparation, revision, and/or evaluation of education sector plans, policies, and programs;
- Conducting quantitative analyses using diverse data sources (e.g., demographic censuses, learning assessment data, household surveys, EMIS, macroeconomic and public finance data, budgets) within the framework of education sector   analyses with focus on financing of education;
- Assisting in the development of projections and simulations for education sector plan preparation and/or revision processes;
- Supporting capacity development activities and training, including conducting needs assessment surveys and developing materials and tools targeted at beneficiaries of technical assistance projects, such as education officers and planners at national and subnational levels;
- Contributing to research and development (R&D) initiatives related to education sector analysis, planning, and management, including the development of innovative techniques and tools and the updating of existing methodologies;
- Assisting in communication efforts for the team as requested.
